[38;2;124;124;124mWe have a simple graph $G$ with 100 vertices. For each vertex $u$, there exists [0m[38;2;124;124;124ma vertex $v \in N(u)$ such that $N(u) \cap N(v) = \emptyset$. We need to find [0m
